 decides to use Heracles' complete moral opposite: the infamous serial killer Jack the Ripper—leaving human beings unsure who they should support.\n\nMeanwhile, tensions begin to rise between various divine pantheons, and rumors of a traitor jeopardize the unity of those who want to annihilate humanity. As the line between friend and foe becomes blurred, Brunhilde will do everything she can to make her machinations successful.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Gods","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Death Game","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mythology","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Afterlife","rank":64,"spoiler":true},{"name":"CGI","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Assassins","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Full CGI","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Sumo","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yandere","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dancing","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Record of Ragnarok II","english":"Record of Ragnarok II","native":"終末のワルキューレⅡ","romaji":"Shuumatsu no Valkyrie II","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"終末のワルキューレⅡ 前編"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"终末的女武神Ⅱ 前篇"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"终末的女武神 第二季 前篇"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Record of Ragnarok Season 2 Part 1"}]},"trailer":{"id":"80cbzfki5kk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/80cbzfki5kk/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}